# Dress Down is on the battlefield before Borg Cube enters, and Quakestrider Ceratops stations the Cube to twelve charge counters.
# Its 12+ striation is one static ability whose effect began in layer 4 (CR 721.2a-b), so its layer 6 part keeps applying although
# Dress Down, earlier in layer 6, took the Cube's abilities (CR 613.6) - and that part gives the Cube, after Dress Down, the static
# ability "Artifact creatures you control have flying" (CR 613.1f, 613.7a): the Cube and Memnite fly; the Ceratops, no artifact,
# does not.

